@@ -2,0 +3,14 @@
+## Phase 13A authorized source implementation — 2026-10-01
+
+**Phase 13A IMPLEMENTED / READY FOR REVIEW; Phase 13 IN PROGRESS;
+Phase 14 NOT STARTED.** Phase 12 and P12-05 remain ACCEPTED / CLOSED.
+Brian authorizes the backend listing/image foundation from local main 653fae52:
+six-record migration 0017_listing_images, immutable filesystem blobs, thumbnail-v1,
+owner-authenticated API, durable receipts/order and report-only consistency.
+[Plan 103](docs/plans/103-phase-13-image-ingestion.md) records the bounded scope,
+focused disposable evidence and [proposed privacy policy](docs/IMAGE_PRIVACY_POLICY.md).
+Shipping policy is not approved; no production deployment or live access occurs.
+No polished upload UI, recognition, provider, Android or deletion work is included.
+Main stays uncommitted/unpushed with empty index and protected dirty bytes intact;
+source review is published separately at `astra_response/Phase-13/13A/r1/`.
+
